<title>UK: UK meals and feeds quiet despite lower prices.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds quiet despite lower prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the UK meals and feeds market was quiet on Monday with many players disappointed by sellers' levels at the opening.</p>
<p>&quot;We looked at the dollar and the stories of rain in Brazil and thought prices would come much lower,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was offered around two stg down, but no business was reported.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
